WEBVTT

00:31:29.750 --> 00:31:31.476
in service of achieving my goals.

00:31:31.500 --> 00:31:35.934
I hate the fact that unlike
writing the best book I can write

00:31:35.958 --> 00:31:38.934
or preparing as hard
as I can to give a talk,

00:31:38.958 --> 00:31:40.768
that's going to resonate with people,

00:31:40.792 --> 00:31:42.434
when it comes to achieving a goal

00:31:42.458 --> 00:31:44.643
of building a great relationship
with someone,

00:31:44.667 --> 00:31:47.643
I don't have the same level
of control over attaining that goal

00:31:47.667 --> 00:31:50.518
than I do the more individual goals
that I direct myself to.

00:31:50.542 --> 00:31:53.268
And it makes me want to
deprioritize relationships

00:31:53.292 --> 00:31:55.309
because I don't know if I'll succeed.

00:31:55.333 --> 00:31:57.559
EP: I get it. I totally --

00:31:57.583 --> 00:31:59.893
AG: I've never had
that thought before, in fact.

00:31:59.917 --> 00:32:00.934
(Laughter)